{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Farid, the new student!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> <strong>UNION Campus</strong> as <strong>Farid</strong>. Discover new places, collect data, and find the secrets behind the mysteries he encounters. Take the opportunity to visit and meet some new people on <strong>Farid's</strong> first day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/extras/39faf9374c31913d5a7d8773db11e207.poster.avif?t=1768631155\" width=142 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/extras/39faf9374c31913d5a7d8773db11e207.webm?t=1768631155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/extras/e288c52695b7f1fc223d7545bf221622.poster.avif?t=1768631155\" width=472 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/extras/e288c52695b7f1fc223d7545bf221622.webm?t=1768631155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/extras/e288c52695b7f1fc223d7545bf221622.mp4?t=1768631155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>However, a crisis appears!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown city gangsters suddenly barged into the university to wreak havoc! <strong>Farid</strong> has no choice but to handle the situation, classic action movie style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/extras/47a38c3b2bb5937889a0b9cd322a062e.poster.avif?t=1768631155\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/extras/47a38c3b2bb5937889a0b9cd322a062e.webm?t=1768631155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/extras/47a38c3b2bb5937889a0b9cd322a062e.mp4?t=1768631155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo and co-op </strong>modes<strong>, </strong>local and online<strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper-comical </strong>beat 'em up with<strong> juicy combos</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn </strong>sprites, environment, as well as effects and animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic environment</strong> to experiment with traps and other weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new abilities and skills</strong> from fights to develop your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character selection</strong> and <strong>customization</strong> (skill tree and equipment).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day</strong> and <strong>night</strong> cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <strong>side quest</strong> and <strong>mini games</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More places</strong> to explore, <strong>more enemies</strong> to face, and <strong>more mysteries\u00a0</strong>waiting to be solved!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3533170?t=1768631155","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/2e505f1ae4517f9b5402b81c98cb5ae06c2b6be0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768631155","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/e