ter selection</strong> and <strong>customization</strong> (skill tree and equipment).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day</strong> and <strong>night</strong> cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <strong>side quest</strong> and <strong>mini games</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More places</strong> to explore, <strong>more enemies</strong> to face, and <strong>more mysteries\u00a0</strong>waiting to be solved!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Team Batalion","Vifth Floor"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533170/52d9aeb82e355c728f416951d50d41c7a49d4ba4/header.jpg?t=1768631155","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3533170/2121006079/209edd95eb77e6b1c2b1c1734e8d7406319e0ce0/1750858747/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748877967","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3533170/2121006079/209edd95eb77e6b1c2b1c1734e8d7406319e0ce0/1750858747/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748877967","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3533170/2121006079/209edd95eb77e6b1c2b1c1734e8d7406319e0ce0/1750858747/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748877967","id":257149614,"name":"Steam Demo Out Now Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149614/932ff2bc1e4e6cf0c975615aa18dcd89493010dc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748877967"}],"name":"Garuda Emblem","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core 2 Duo E7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce